# Deployment Guide

## Build
```bash
cd app && npm run build   # tsc -b && vite build
```

## Deploy to Production
```bash
cd app && npx vercel --prod
```
Vercel's Git auto-deploy has been unreliable (disconnects). Always verify on the Vercel dashboard that a new deployment appeared after `git push`. If not, deploy manually with the command above.

## Common Build Failures
- TypeScript strict mode: unused variables (`TS6133`) and duplicate JSX attributes (`TS17001`) will fail the build
- Always run `npm run build` locally before deploying to catch errors

## Post-Deploy: Supabase Migrations
If schema changes were made, run ALTER TABLE statements in the Supabase SQL Editor manually. Example:
```sql
ALTER TABLE push_subscriptions ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS last_sent jsonb DEFAULT '{}'::jsonb;
```

## Push Notifications
- cron-job.org pings `/api/push/cron` every 5 minutes with `Authorization: Bearer <CRON_SECRET>`
- `CRON_SECRET` must match between cron-job.org header and Vercel env var
- Vercel cron (`vercel.json`) runs daily at 3 AM UTC as fallback only
